  "functionalAcceptance": "15 matched states pass; visual polish remains required",
  "findings": [
    "Initial provider menu screenshot captures a blurred transition; need settled menu capture.",
    "Largest selected Apple or built-in value truncates; native connection menu full alternatives are readable.",
    "Preference toggles visibly on then off, but label hyphenates connection at largest size.",
    "Client ID and some endpoint fields add visual hyphens not present in exact asserted strings.",
    "Native editing menus, caret, drawn keys and Done appear across all6 ordinary editable fields. Selected full values may extend below keyboard; no complete-value visual proof from those single frames.",
    "Sign in again is disabled while draft dirty; Sign in with Google enabled after saved client/scopes invalidates old matching account.",
    "Saved status still says Tap Connect; copy fix required.",
    "Built-in availability factual on simulator; no Apple inference acceptance.",
    "Save enabled for draft and disabled after save; form scrolls, navigation controls remain visible. Secure key pixels are not visible, do not infer value from screenshot."
  ]
